  "solution": "**Concept:**\n\n** [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b85f6f9155b46d7ff3d549ba0a0da1fe9f95be993a1e930d360951a2d5f64825.png] **\n\nCalculation:\n\n**(5)/(11) of (3)/(7)+(7)/(11)times(55)/(21)-(8)/(22)div(16)/(33)**\n\n⇒ (5/11)(3/7) + (7/11)(55/21) - (8/22)/(16/33)\n\n⇒ (15/77) + (5/3) - (3/4)\n\n⇒ [(45 + 385)/231] - (3/4)\n\n⇒ (430/231) - (3/4)\n\n⇒ (1720 - 693)/924 = 1027/924\n\n**∴ The value of the given equation is (1027)/(924).**",
